IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `snap-core`
IMPORT `snap5-s2025-ab`

-- TESTS for snap5-s2025-ab.l4 (section 2025(a) and (b)). Expected values written from the text before the file was run.

§ `s 2025(a) the share of administrative costs`

-- "through fiscal year 2026, 50 percent, and for fiscal year 2027 and each fiscal year thereafter, 25 percent"; edge at 2026 / 2027
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the share of administrative costs the Secretary is authorized to pay` 2026 EQUALS JUST 0.50
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the share of administrative costs the Secretary is authorized to pay` 2025 EQUALS JUST 0.50
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the share of administrative costs the Secretary is authorized to pay` 2027 EQUALS JUST 0.25
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the share of administrative costs the Secretary is authorized to pay` 2040 EQUALS JUST 0.25
-- 50 percent of 1,000 is 500; 25 percent of 1,000 is 250
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the amount the Secretary is authorized to pay before any reduction under subsection (k)` 2026 1_000 EQUALS JUST 500
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the amount the Secretary is authorized to pay before any reduction under subsection (k)` 2027 1_000 EQUALS JUST 250

§ `s 2025(a) the kinds of administrative cost`

#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the cost is an administrative cost the Secretary is authorized to pay a share of` `s 2025(a)(1) certification of applicant households` NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the cost is an administrative cost the Secretary is authorized to pay a share of` `s 2025(a)(2) acceptance, storage, protection, control, and accounting of benefits after delivery to receiving points within the State` NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the cost is an administrative cost the Secretary is authorized to pay a share of` `s 2025(a)(3) issuance of benefits to all eligible households` NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the cost is an administrative cost the Secretary is authorized to pay a share of` `s 2025(a)(4) informational activities relating to the program` NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the cost is an administrative cost the Secretary is authorized to pay a share of` `s 2025(a)(5) fair hearings` NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the cost is an administrative cost the Secretary is authorized to pay a share of` `s 2025(a)(7) investigations and prosecutions` NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the cost is an administrative cost the Secretary is authorized to pay a share of` `s 2025(a)(8) implementing and operating the immigration status verification system` NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the cost is an administrative cost the Secretary is authorized to pay a share of` `s 2025(a)(9) establishing and operating a longitudinal database` NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- recruitment and television, radio or billboard promotion are taken out in the text's own words
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the cost is an administrative cost the Secretary is authorized to pay a share of` `s 2025(a)(4) recruitment activities to persuade an individual to apply, or promotion of the program on television, radio, or billboards` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- clause (6) is subject to the conditions of subsection (g)
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the cost is an administrative cost the Secretary is authorized to pay a share of` `s 2025(a)(6) automated data processing and information retrieval systems` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the cost is an administrative cost the Secretary is authorized to pay a share of` `s 2025(a)(6) automated data processing and information retrieval systems` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the cost is an administrative cost the Secretary is authorized to pay a share of` `s 2025(a)(6) automated data processing and information retrieval systems` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- "shall include, but not be limited to": a cost not listed is not covered
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the cost is an administrative cost the Secretary is authorized to pay a share of` `s 2025(a) any other cost` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 2025(a) the proviso`

#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the additional amount the Secretary may pay a State agency for a reservation or a Native village` TRUE FALSE (JUST 5_000) EQUALS JUST 5_000
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the additional amount the Secretary may pay a State agency for a reservation or a Native village` FALSE TRUE (JUST 5_000) EQUALS JUST 5_000
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the additional amount the Secretary may pay a State agency for a reservation or a Native village` TRUE TRUE (JUST 5_000) EQUALS JUST 5_000
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the additional amount the Secretary may pay a State agency for a reservation or a Native village` FALSE FALSE (JUST 5_000) EQUALS NOTHING
-- no determination of the amount supplied
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the additional amount the Secretary may pay a State agency for a reservation or a Native village` TRUE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

-- 35 percent of what is recovered under section 2015(b) or 2022(c); 20 percent of any other, except what arises from a State agency's error
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the share of recovered or collected funds the Secretary may permit the State to retain` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `s 2025(a) may be permitted to retain` 0.35
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the share of recovered or collected funds the Secretary may permit the State to retain` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `s 2025(a) may be permitted to retain` 0.35
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the share of recovered or collected funds the Secretary may permit the State to retain` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `s 2025(a) may be permitted to retain` 0.20
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the share of recovered or collected funds the Secretary may permit the State to retain` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `s 2025(a) may not be permitted to retain under this proviso`
-- the reading taken (F-3): the exception qualifies only the 20 percent limb, so a 2015(b) recovery that arose from a State agency's error is still at 35 percent
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the share of recovered or collected funds the Secretary may permit the State to retain` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `s 2025(a) may be permitted to retain` 0.35

#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the official may receive or benefit from the revenues retained by the State` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the official may receive or benefit from the revenues retained by the State` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 2025(b)(1) work supplementation or support program defined`

#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(1) the program is a work supplementation or support program` TRUE TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(1) the program is a work supplementation or support program` TRUE TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(1) the program is a work supplementation or support program` TRUE TRUE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(1) the program is a work supplementation or support program` FALSE TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(1) the program is a work supplementation or support program` TRUE FALSE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(1) the program is a work supplementation or support program` TRUE TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 2025(b)(2) to (6)`

#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(2) the State agency may elect to use an amount equal to the allotment to subsidize or support the job` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(2) the State agency may elect to use an amount equal to the allotment to subsidize or support the job` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(3) the procedure applies` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(3) the procedure applies` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(3) the procedure applies` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(3)(A) the amount the Secretary shall pay the State agency` (JUST TRUE) 300 EQUALS JUST 300
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(3)(A) the amount the Secretary shall pay the State agency` (JUST FALSE) 300 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(3)(A) the amount the Secretary shall pay the State agency` NOTHING 300 EQUALS NOTHING

-- edge: the whole amount received must be expended
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(3)(B) the State agency has expended the amount as required` (JUST TRUE) 300 300 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(3)(B) the State agency has expended the amount as required` (JUST TRUE) 300 299 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(3)(B) the State agency has expended the amount as required` (JUST TRUE) 300 301 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(3)(B) the State agency has expended the amount as required` (JUST FALSE) 300 0 EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(3)(C)(i) the amount received is excluded from household income and resources for sections 2014 and 2017(a)` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(3)(C)(i) the amount received is excluded from household income and resources for sections 2014 and 2017(a)` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(3)(C)(ii) the amount received is considered the value of an allotment provided to the household for section 2017(b)` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(3)(C)(ii) the amount received is considered the value of an allotment provided to the household for section 2017(b)` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(3)(D) the household may receive an allotment from the State agency for the period` (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(3)(D) the household may receive an allotment from the State agency for the period` (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(3)(D) the household may receive an allotment from the State agency for the period` (JUST FALSE) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(4) the individual is excused from a work requirement under section 2015(d) by reason of the fact that the State has a work supplementation or support program` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(4) the individual is excused from a work requirement under section 2015(d) by reason of the fact that the State has a work supplementation or support program` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(4) the individual is excused from a work requirement under section 2015(d) by reason of the fact that the State has a work supplementation or support program` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(5) the State agency has provided the description required` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(5) the State agency has provided the description required` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(5) the State agency has provided the description required` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(6) the work supplementation or support program is permitted` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2025(b)(6) the work supplementation or support program is permitted` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `every declared type and constructor is used`

#ASSERT `s 2025(a)(1) certification of applicant households` EQUALS `s 2025(a)(1) certification of applicant households`
#ASSERT `s 2025(a)(2) acceptance, storage, protection, control, and accounting of benefits after delivery to receiving points within the State` EQUALS `s 2025(a)(2) acceptance, storage, protection, control, and accounting of benefits after delivery to receiving points within the State`
#ASSERT `s 2025(a)(3) issuance of benefits to all eligible households` EQUALS `s 2025(a)(3) issuance of benefits to all eligible households`
#ASSERT `s 2025(a)(4) informational activities relating to the program` EQUALS `s 2025(a)(4) informational activities relating to the program`
#ASSERT `s 2025(a)(4) recruitment activities to persuade an individual to apply, or promotion of the program on television, radio, or billboards` EQUALS `s 2025(a)(4) recruitment activities to persuade an individual to apply, or promotion of the program on television, radio, or billboards`
#ASSERT `s 2025(a)(5) fair hearings` EQUALS `s 2025(a)(5) fair hearings`
#ASSERT `s 2025(a)(6) automated data processing and information retrieval systems` EQUALS `s 2025(a)(6) automated data processing and information retrieval systems`
#ASSERT `s 2025(a)(7) investigations and prosecutions` EQUALS `s 2025(a)(7) investigations and prosecutions`
#ASSERT `s 2025(a)(8) implementing and operating the immigration status verification system` EQUALS `s 2025(a)(8) implementing and operating the immigration status verification system`
#ASSERT `s 2025(a)(9) establishing and operating a longitudinal database` EQUALS `s 2025(a)(9) establishing and operating a longitudinal database`
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) any other cost` EQUALS `s 2025(a) any other cost`
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) may be permitted to retain` 0.35 EQUALS `s 2025(a) may be permitted to retain` 0.35
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) may not be permitted to retain under this proviso` EQUALS `s 2025(a) may not be permitted to retain under this proviso`

-- s 2025(a): the part of a claim (the core's Claim: amount, who owes it, to whom) the State may be permitted to retain.
`s 2025(a) test claim` MEANS Claim OF 1000, `a household member`, `the State agency`
`s 2025(a) test empty claim` MEANS Claim OF 0, `a household member`, `the State agency`
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the amount of the claim the State may be permitted to retain, in dollars` `s 2025(a) test claim` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS 350
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the amount of the claim the State may be permitted to retain, in dollars` `s 2025(a) test claim` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS 350
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the amount of the claim the State may be permitted to retain, in dollars` `s 2025(a) test claim` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS 350
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the amount of the claim the State may be permitted to retain, in dollars` `s 2025(a) test claim` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS 200
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the amount of the claim the State may be permitted to retain, in dollars` `s 2025(a) test claim` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS 0
-- the reading taken (F-3): the exception qualifies only the 20 percent limb, so a section 2015(b) recovery that arose from the State agency's error is still kept at 35 percent
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the amount of the claim the State may be permitted to retain, in dollars` `s 2025(a) test claim` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS 350
#ASSERT `s 2025(a) the amount of the claim the State may be permitted to retain, in dollars` `s 2025(a) test empty claim` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS 0
